the Taipei Assassins run in 2012 the

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:13.200
Taiwanese outfit became overnight
sensations not only for their incredible

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:18.000
play but for decisively overcoming
arguably the three strongest teams at

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.900
the tournament in a series of
history-making upsets this is when

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.320
assassins ruled the world

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:29.120
