they had utterly dominated their home

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:08.130
region thanks to strong team
coordination and creative play it was

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:12.119
unknown how that would translate against
the world's best on league's biggest

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:17.580
stage but as we all know assassins work
best with the element of surprise as

00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:22.290
champions of their region the Taipei
Assassins were seeded  directly into the

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:26.180
