representative the intimidating

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:32.940
NaJin Sword
who had steamrolled their group while

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:35.600
TPA were coming in cold

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:39.440
Lead by Lau "Toyz" Wai Kin and his now legendary Orianna

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:43.720
